BOARD_NOTES="For Milo 2.0 machines built with the Universal Electronics Box: BTT Scylla v1.0 mainboard with integrated TMC2160 drivers at 48v, the BOM NEMA23 2.8A motors, TR8x8 leadscrews and LJ8A3-2-Z/AY inductive endstops. Rapid feed-rates are significantly increased."